### T3-Payruns — Scenario Validation & Reports
### Prerequisite: T1-Bootstrap must be completed first
###
### NOTE: Live payrun execution (monthly/biweekly/weekly jobs) is done via
###       WebApp or REST API — there is no pecmd PayrunJobStart command.
###       This script validates specific scenarios with PayrunEmployeePreviewTest
###       and generates reports from completed payrun data.

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Scenario 1 — January baseline
### Run the full T1 integration test suite (imports cases + runs payrun + verifies)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# See Tests/Run.Tests.pecmd for the full test suite (8 employees, Jan 2026).
# Run that file directly for the baseline:
#   pecmd Tests/Run.Tests.pecmd

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Scenario 2 — March: Jessica $10,000 performance bonus (supplemental wages)
###   PayrunEmployeeTest is self-contained: imports cases from et.json,
###   runs payrun job, compares results. No separate PayrollImport needed.
###   /OkOnFail because payrollResults are empty (no assertions yet).
###   Actual results written to March-Bonus.actual.json for later assertion.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PayrunEmployeeTest Scenarios/March-Bonus-Preview.et.json /showall /OkOnFail ActualOutputFile:Scenarios/March-Bonus.actual.json

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Reports — prerequisite: payruns for the target period must be complete
### All paths are relative to T3-Payruns/ (pecmd working directory)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Payslip — Sara Chen, January 2026 (Monthly payroll)
Report tenant:Apex.DigitalSolutions user:apex.admin@apexdigital.com regulation:US.Payroll report:US.Payslip culture:en-US parameterFile:Reports/Payslip-Sara-January.parameters.json /pdf /shellopen

